From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NotAlexNoyle <alexnoyle@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 00:11:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] videocontrols: the bar shows on pause and stays while paused
 (touch, T-285)

A touch screen has no pointer to hover the control bar back with: on the
TouchPad a tap on a playing video paused it and the bar, faded out two
seconds after the tap's own hover, never came back (measured 2026-11-08 on
the three Jihad shells with the emulated finger). The "pause" media event
now fades the bar in and clears the hide timer, and _hideControlsFn leaves a
paused (not ended) video's bar alone; play still hides it after the usual
timeout.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 toolkit/content/widgets/videocontrols.xml | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/toolkit/content/widgets/videocontrols.xml b/toolkit/content/widgets/videocontrols.xml
index c118110536..0829640938 100644
--- a/toolkit/content/widgets/videocontrols.xml
+++ b/toolkit/content/widgets/videocontrols.xml
@@ -508,6 +508,14 @@
                             if (!this.scrubber.isDragging)
                                 this.setPlayButtonState(true);
                             this.stopScrubTimer();    // Jihad: no interpolation while paused
+                            // Jihad: a touch screen has no pointer to hover the bar back with. A pause (the
+                            // tap on the picture) shows the bar and keeps it (_hideControlsFn) until play.
+                            if (!this.isAudioOnly && this.dynamicControls) {
+                                clearTimeout(this._hideControlsTimeout);
+                                this._hideControlsTimeout = 0;
+                                this.startFadeIn(this.controlBar);
+                                this._controlsHiddenByTimeout = false;
+                            }
                             this.setupStatusFader();
                             break;
                         case "ended":
@@ -937,6 +945,8 @@
 
                 _hideControlsTimeout : 0,
                 _hideControlsFn : function () {
+                    // Jihad: never while paused — a finger has no hover to bring the bar back (see "pause")
+                    if (Utils.video.paused && !Utils.video.ended) { Utils._hideControlsTimeout = 0; return; }
                     if (!Utils.scrubber.isDragging) {
                         Utils.startFade(Utils.controlBar, false);
                         Utils._hideControlsTimeout = 0;
